{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Dungeon Crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a randomly generated labyrinth and encounter a variety of enemies and events. Build your party with different skills and equipments to defeat strong enemies and to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth Trailblazer takes traditional Dungeon Crawler and streamlines it for a more roguelike approach making it easier to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person dungeon crawler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.poster.avif?t=1774016950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.webm?t=1774016950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.mp4?t=1774016950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based party combat: Characters and enemies will take one turn each before they can act again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shows the outcome of your actions in complex scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.poster.avif?t=1774016950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati