 members and heal your party at campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.poster.avif?t=1774016950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.webm?t=1774016950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.mp4?t=1774016950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add markers for points of interest on your map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.poster.avif?t=1774016950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.webm?t=1774016950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.mp4?t=1774016950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You grow strong very quickly but if you are defeated, you will need to restart from the beginning. It is quick to start another run and try again with a new strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ animated monsters</p></